  data: {
    LLM: "If you win the bid, use the kitty to 'flush' your hand of non-trump suits. Keeping only trumps and high cards (Aces/Tens) is the path to winning the 'Game' point.\n\nTrump Pulling: If you have the Ace of trumps, lead it early to draw out the opponents' Joker and Jack. This 'purifies' the remaining trumps for your partner.\n\nDefense: If the opponents bid 5 (the maximum), your only goal is to 'Set' them by stealing just one of the 5 points. Focus your play on capturing the Joker or the Jack specifically.",
    Player: "If you win the bid, use the kitty to 'flush' your hand of non-trump suits. Keeping only trumps and high cards (Aces/Tens) is the path to winning the 'Game' point.\n\nTrump Pulling: If you have the Ace of trumps, lead it early to draw out the opponents' Joker and Jack. This 'purifies' the remaining trumps for your partner.\n\nDefense: If the opponents bid 5 (the maximum), your only goal is to 'Set' them by stealing just one of the 5 points. Focus your play on capturing the Joker or the Jack specifically.",
